    - target: {fileID: 2189733109407162466, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: Scarlett
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: stats.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: activateQuestion.text
      value: Acquire?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: stats.Array.data[0].text
      value: 'Passive: Restore a percentage of damage as health.


        Ability:
        Swipe, dealing massive damage in a large area.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[1].cost
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[2].cost
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: stats.Array.data[0].speaker
      value: Scythe
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[0].dialogue.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[1].dialogue.Array.size
      value: 9
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[2].dialogue.Array.size
      value: 9
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[0].dialogue.Array.data[0].text
      value: AHHH!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[0].dialogue.Array.data[1].text
      value: You scared me! Dont just pop into peoples private spaces like that!!!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[0].dialogue.Array.data[2].text
      value: W-what?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[0].dialogue.Array.data[3].text
      value: You want me to help with t-that?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[0].dialogue.Array.data[4].text
      value: "I\u2026 uh well\u2026 okay! I\u2019ll do my best!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[0].dialogue.Array.data[5].text
      value: "I\u2026 uh well\u2026 okay! I\u2019ll do my best!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[1].dialogue.Array.data[0].text
      value: Oh hey, at least you knocked this time.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[1].dialogue.Array.data[1].text
      value: Well, what do you want?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[1].dialogue.Array.data[2].text
      value: O-oh you just wanted to check in on me?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[1].dialogue.Array.data[3].text
      value: "I\u2019m doing fine. Thanks..."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[1].dialogue.Array.data[4].text
      value: "Listen, there\u2019s something I wanted to talk to you about."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[1].dialogue.Array.data[5].text
      value: S-something important.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[1].dialogue.Array.data[6].text
      value: "I\u2026 I really\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[1].dialogue.Array.data[7].text
      value: I really really really-
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[1].dialogue.Array.data[8].text
      value: "Gah! I can\u2019t say it! Uhm, just forget about all that, okay?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[2].dialogue.Array.data[0].text
      value: H-hey. Welcome back.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[2].dialogue.Array.data[1].text
      value: I'm sorry I haven't been really paying attention recently...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[2].dialogue.Array.data[2].text
      value: "Just... do you ever see them? The people who you\u2019ve reaped?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[2].dialogue.Array.data[3].text
      value: They all live right here, in my head.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[2].dialogue.Array.data[4].text
      value: "\u2026 they won\u2019t go away, no matter how much I try to tell them
        to."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[2].dialogue.Array.data[5].text
      value: "But\u2026 when you\u2019re here, they\u2019re quiet. They shrink away,
        like they\u2019re scared."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[2].dialogue.Array.data[6].text
      value: Please, I ask you, s-stay a little longer.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[2].dialogue.Array.data[7].text
      value: "I\u2026 I really\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[2].dialogue.Array.data[8].text
      value: "Gah! I still can\u2019t say it!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[0].dialogue.Array.data[0].speaker
      value: Scarlett
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[0].dialogue.Array.data[1].speaker
      value: Scarlett
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[0].dialogue.Array.data[2].speaker
      value: Scarlett
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 4311558673823566091, guid: fd145d7e431d7104ebd560b3e62db52b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[0].dialogue.Array.data[3].speaker
