    - target: {fileID: 7501193424126467851, guid: 97b4c640b737b1f4dbe0c979f6c8255a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7501193424126467851, guid: 97b4c640b737b1f4dbe0c979f6c8255a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: activateQuestion.text
      value: Acquire?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7501193424126467851, guid: 97b4c640b737b1f4dbe0c979f6c8255a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: stats.Array.data[0].text
      value: 'Passive: Damage applies Lifebane debuff.


        Ability: Fire a
        volley of arrows.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7501193424126467851, guid: 97b4c640b737b1f4dbe0c979f6c8255a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[1].cost
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7501193424126467851, guid: 97b4c640b737b1f4dbe0c979f6c8255a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[2].cost
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7501193424126467851, guid: 97b4c640b737b1f4dbe0c979f6c8255a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: stats.Array.data[0].speaker
      value: Longbow
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7501193424126467851, guid: 97b4c640b737b1f4dbe0c979f6c8255a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[0].dialogue.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7501193424126467851, guid: 97b4c640b737b1f4dbe0c979f6c8255a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[1].dialogue.Array.size
      value: 7
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7501193424126467851, guid: 97b4c640b737b1f4dbe0c979f6c8255a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[2].dialogue.Array.size
      value: 8
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7501193424126467851, guid: 97b4c640b737b1f4dbe0c979f6c8255a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[0].dialogue.Array.data[0].text
      value: Rabbits and foxes. The hunt never ends.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7501193424126467851, guid: 97b4c640b737b1f4dbe0c979f6c8255a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[0].dialogue.Array.data[1].text
      value: "Let\u2019s show them that even a fox has to worry about being hunted."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7501193424126467851, guid: 97b4c640b737b1f4dbe0c979f6c8255a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[0].dialogue.Array.data[2].text
      value: "Let\u2019s show them that even a fox has to worry about being hunted."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7501193424126467851, guid: 97b4c640b737b1f4dbe0c979f6c8255a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[1].dialogue.Array.data[0].text
      value: "Lifebane. It\u2019s quite the potent poison."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7501193424126467851, guid: 97b4c640b737b1f4dbe0c979f6c8255a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[1].dialogue.Array.data[1].text
      value: 'It comes from a venomous snake that lives in the northern woods.

'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7501193424126467851, guid: 97b4c640b737b1f4dbe0c979f6c8255a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[1].dialogue.Array.data[2].text
      value: The natives once used them sparingly for medicinal purposes. To give
        peace to the dying.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7501193424126467851, guid: 97b4c640b737b1f4dbe0c979f6c8255a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[1].dialogue.Array.data[3].text
      value: However, when the natives showed them to the empire, the beasts were
        hunted to extinction for their venom.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7501193424126467851, guid: 97b4c640b737b1f4dbe0c979f6c8255a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[1].dialogue.Array.data[4].text
      value: Reminds me of myself in a way.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7501193424126467851, guid: 97b4c640b737b1f4dbe0c979f6c8255a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[1].dialogue.Array.data[5].text
      value: You let them in, and they will take everything from you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7501193424126467851, guid: 97b4c640b737b1f4dbe0c979f6c8255a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[1].dialogue.Array.data[6].text
      value: And so you must never let the mask slip.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7501193424126467851, guid: 97b4c640b737b1f4dbe0c979f6c8255a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[2].dialogue.Array.data[0].text
      value: Why do you insist on speaking with me?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7501193424126467851, guid: 97b4c640b737b1f4dbe0c979f6c8255a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[2].dialogue.Array.data[1].text
      value: "You don\u2019t want to see the real me."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7501193424126467851, guid: 97b4c640b737b1f4dbe0c979f6c8255a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[2].dialogue.Array.data[2].text
      value: "You can\u2019t see the real me."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7501193424126467851, guid: 97b4c640b737b1f4dbe0c979f6c8255a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[2].dialogue.Array.data[3].text
      value: "Once you see me for the animal I am\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7501193424126467851, guid: 97b4c640b737b1f4dbe0c979f6c8255a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[2].dialogue.Array.data[4].text
      value: ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7501193424126467851, guid: 97b4c640b737b1f4dbe0c979f6c8255a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[2].dialogue.Array.data[5].text
      value: "You want to be my\u2026 wingman?"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7501193424126467851, guid: 97b4c640b737b1f4dbe0c979f6c8255a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[2].dialogue.Array.data[6].text
      value: "I\u2019m not too sure what that is but\u2026"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7501193424126467851, guid: 97b4c640b737b1f4dbe0c979f6c8255a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[2].dialogue.Array.data[7].text
      value: "Alright. Fine. Let\u2019s give it a shot."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 7501193424126467851, guid: 97b4c640b737b1f4dbe0c979f6c8255a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: levels.Array.data[0].dialogue.Array.data[0].speaker
      value: Lavender
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
